 "_smx1_classRenames_basis": "package-private 1.20.1 classes 1.20.2 moved under another outer class (or to the top level) with the same intermediary id and their members (javap -p of both: DefaultPlayerSkin.ModelType -> PlayerSkin.Model, ClientPacketListener.DeferredPacket -> ClientCommonPacketListenerImpl's, ChatReportScreen's reason list -> AbstractReportScreen's, LevelRenderer's RenderInfoMap / RenderChunkStorage / RenderChunkInfo -> SectionOcclusionGraph's, CompositeFunction's inner class -> the top-level one); nothing outside a mixin can name a package-private class, so only mixins follow",
 "_smx1_covers_basis": "the vanilla recipe serializers' 1.20.1 read(id, json), members again: the layer's CbRecipeJson* mixins restore them with 1.20.1's bodies and 1.20.2's RecipeManager reads through them (CbRecipeJsonVanillaMixin), so mods' calls and super calls link to them as on 1.20.1",
